{"id":"vod_md_4963","vodId":"4963","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"重生计划","name_cn":"重生计划","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"13集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230915-1/f7e2db19e0af256c87985d09897069a2.jpg"},"summary":"海崎新太（小野贤章 配音）的人生在二十七岁之时走入了死胡同之中，工作仅三个月就选择辞职，两次参加考研却均无功而返，想要找一个可以糊口的工作却屡屡失败受挫，新太不知道也不想知道，究竟还会有什么在未来等待着他。某日，新太失魂落魄的走在街头，偶然遇见了一位名叫夜明了（木村良平 配音）的神秘男子，并邀请他参加一个看起来极为不祥的实验。在巨大的利益诱惑和保证能够找到工作的承诺面前，满腹疑虑的新太产生了动摇。按照要求，新太将要服下一颗神秘的药丸，之后，他的外表将会回到十七岁的样子，新太需要进入高中三年级就读，整个实验为期一年。就这样，新太回到了校园之中，在这里，等待着他的会是怎样的生活呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-15 07:48:04","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230913/gEeFTDls/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230913/SfaeTW0p/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230913/kjqNYNnL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230913/K9JSWQ1F/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230913/uvCtVxnP/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230913/aIQSPe8z/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230913/yFXOoGI2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230913/ylXMhrnN/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230913/9gwanbSm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230913/uEU824q8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230913/zkwxYq28/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230913/8RyLQfJe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230913/SiVMIz2w/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:48:48.479Z"}